sequenceDiagram
    actor Insp as Inspector
    participant UI as Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Svc as Inspection service
    participant DB as Database
    participant ML as Detector and OCR
    Insp->>UI: Create inspection, choose files
    UI->>API: POST /api/inspections
    API->>DB: insert inspection (CREATED)
    UI->>API: POST /api/inspections/{id}/files
    API->>DB: save file records
    UI->>API: POST /api/inspections/{id}/process
    API->>DB: create processing job (QUEUED)
    API-->>UI: 202 job_id
    API->>Svc: run job in background
    Svc->>ML: parse documents, detect, OCR
    Svc->>Svc: match and evaluate rules
    Svc->>DB: save objects, checks, evidence
    loop polling
        UI->>API: GET /api/inspections/{id}/status
        API-->>UI: PROCESSING / AWAITING_REVIEW
    end
    UI->>API: GET /api/inspections/{id}/results
    Insp->>UI: review REVIEW items
    UI->>API: POST /api/inspections/{id}/checks/{check_id}/review
